    <data key="d0">Zigbang Hybrid Duplexing Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0F7KDLz-kIQ</data>
    <data key="d2">Zigbang utilizes a hybrid backend architecture combining ECS/Fargate and API Gateway/Lambda to handle spikes during marketing push events while balancing costs. An internal Route 53 instance dynamically splits traffic using real-time feedback from CloudWatch and AWS SDK.</data>
    <data key="d3">Hybrid Architecture, Serverless, Auto Scaling, Traffic Weighting</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
